OL,3,GNEWSANo trains between York and Leeds
OL,4,Afor nine days
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo trains will run on the main route
OL,7,Fbetween Leeds and York for nine days,
OL,8,FNetwork Rail has said.
OL,10,FThe closure, between 24 October and 1
OL,11,FNovember, will allow the replacement of
OL,12,Fa railway bridge in Church Fenton.
OL,14,FDirect rail replacement buses will be
OL,15,Fin operation as the quickest way to
OL,16,Ftravel between the two cities during
OL,17,Fthis time, a spokesperson said, along
OL,18,Fwith local stopping bus services for
OL,19,Fstations in between.
OL,21,FA longer Northern service via Harrogate
OL,22,Fwill also run as normal.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
